# PDF Library – Reader
## Support & Help Center

Welcome to the PDF Library – Reader Support Center!

We're here to help you get the most out of your PDF reading experience.

### About the App

PDF Library – Reader helps you import, organize, and read PDF documents in one convenient place.

Enjoy easy document management, customizable reading features, and quick access to your favorite files.

### Frequently Asked Questions

**How do I import PDF files?**

Open PDF Library – Reader, select the Import or Add option, and choose a PDF document from your device.

**How do I organize my documents?**

Create custom folders in your library and move your imported PDF documents into the folders you prefer.

**Can I zoom in and out?**

Yes. Use pinch gestures to zoom in or out while viewing a PDF document.

**Can I highlight text?**

Use the highlighting tool to mark important text in supported PDF documents.

**Can I bookmark pages?**

Use the bookmark option to save pages you want to revisit.

**Can I change the font size?**

If your app version supports text reading mode, you can adjust the font size for a more comfortable reading experience. Standard PDF page layouts use zoom controls instead.

**Where are my PDF files stored?**

Imported documents are stored locally on your device unless an optional cloud storage feature is enabled.

### Troubleshooting

If you experience an issue:

1. Close and reopen the app.
2. Make sure your device has enough available storage.
3. Check that your PDF file is valid and not password-protected.
4. Update to the latest available version of the app.
5. Contact support if the issue continues.

